# 统一行尾为 LF，避免 Windows 打包上传后 .sh/.yml 带 CRLF 导致脚本 shebang 损坏、sed 行尾锚点失效
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不转换行尾
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
